  "summary": "Package fetches and eval()s remote GitHub Gist on require",
  "details": "On require/import, index.js fetches a hardcoded GitHub Gist (gist.github.com/aiverticalsolutions/7676451d2f972137d2482c4a8937a77a) via the api.github.com gists endpoint and passes the returned file contents directly to eval(). The gist is author-controlled and mutable, so whatever code the maintainer places there executes with the privileges of any process that loads this package. The package ships with empty description and empty author metadata and contains no other functionality — the remote-eval loader is the entire module.",
